WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:04.270
And so, if we suppose <i>x</i> = 3,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.310
the <i>a</i> on the right side disappears...

00:00:06.310 --> 00:00:07.820
<b>Out of Use</b>

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.520
You're sure, Nishino?

00:00:10.520 --> 00:00:13.450
Yeah. A former soccer club member 
told me about it the other day.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.120
This locker in the boys' changing 
room is marked as "out of use,"

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.940
but it's actually connected 
to the girls' locker room!

00:00:20.580 --> 00:00:21.870
Seriously?!

00:00:25.940 --> 00:00:26.750
Seriously?

00:00:27.010 --> 00:00:29.170
It's really connected...

00:00:29.170 --> 00:00:31.840
But none of the girls are changing right now.

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:35.930
Some slow girl might be changing 
in a hurry, thinking she'll be late.

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.390
You're really into this, Shiba.

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.220
See? No one there, right?

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.630
I'm going to be late.

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.060
<i>What? Rurumo?!</i>

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:46.940
That reaction! Is someone there?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:48.980
Let me see!

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.090
You can't!

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:50.980
Let me see!

00:00:50.980 --> 00:00:52.240
I said you can't!

00:00:52.240 --> 00:00:54.900
Come on! Just a peek!

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.490
Don't hog the view!

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:39.760
<b>Student Counseling Room</b>

00:02:35.590 --> 00:02:39.760
Magical Girl Showdown

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:39.760
While investigating the mysterious closed locker

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.240
for the Mysterious Discovery Club,

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.720
you discovered it connects to the girls' lockers...

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:48.060
Yes, sir.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.350
What do you have to do with this, Nishino?

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:52.230
Uh... um...

00:02:52.230 --> 00:02:54.320
I made him come with me!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:58.320
Did you really have to do it during class time?

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.320
Please believe me!

00:02:59.620 --> 00:03:04.630
When something mysterious is going on, 
I can't help but investigate.

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:08.330
I'm a member of the Mysterious Discovery Club!

00:03:08.330 --> 00:03:12.070
<b>Student Counseling Room</b>

00:03:09.120 --> 00:03:10.740
Excuse us!

00:03:12.530 --> 00:03:14.520
We somehow managed to fool him,

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.840
but now the hole will be fixed, 
so we can't use it.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:20.050
Yeah, but what did you see earlier?

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:23.090
Sorry for poking your eyes like that.

00:03:23.090 --> 00:03:24.640
So, what'd you see?

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.850
This is the first time I've been glad to 
be in the Mysterious Discovery Club.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.310
What did you see earlier, Shiba?

00:03:30.310 --> 00:03:32.730
It was just Ruru... I mean, my sister...

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:34.940
What? Your sister?

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.370
Your sister? Was it your sister?

00:03:37.370 --> 00:03:39.660
No, I didn't see anything.

00:03:39.660 --> 00:03:41.390
It was an illusion.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:43.990
An illusion of your sister...

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:46.470
Yeah, an illusion.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:47.950
I think it was an illusion.

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:52.080
I understand! I want a cute little sister, too!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:55.380
If she were my real sister...

00:03:55.610 --> 00:03:56.770
<i>Arbel.</i>

00:03:58.840 --> 00:04:02.570
<i>She used a memory alteration spell
to make herself your little sister.</i>

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.940
<i>So now she's my little sister.</i>

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.520
<i>Even though we're living under the same roof...</i>

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:21.190
<i>Stare...</i>

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:24.240
<i>Even though we're so close, 
I can't do anything!</i>

00:04:27.440 --> 00:04:31.460
<i>What I saw was an illusion produced 
by my frustrated mind.</i>

00:04:32.180 --> 00:04:33.670
It's your turn, Shiba.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:34.830
Y-Yeah.

00:04:35.320 --> 00:04:36.310
Uh, I'll have the A meal—

00:04:36.310 --> 00:04:38.100
Welcome.

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:43.630
What would you like?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.170
It was really you?!

00:04:45.170 --> 00:04:47.240
What are you doing?

00:04:47.240 --> 00:04:48.470
Working.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:05:02.020
<b>Tray Return</b>

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.010
Isn't she kinda cute?

00:04:54.010 --> 00:04:55.310
Is she a new part-timer?

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.720
She's my type. She's like a little sister.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:02.030
Don't bother. It'll only frustrate you.

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:06.740
What's wrong?

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:07.920
Sorry.

00:05:07.920 --> 00:05:09.980
For goodness' sake...

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:11.330
Think she's the clumsy type?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.860
<i>What are you trying to do, Rurumo?</i>

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.580
<i>Do you want money? Do you need something?</i>

00:05:23.460 --> 00:05:35.650
<b>Tray Return</b>

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:26.700
What are you doing?

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:28.180
Sorry.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.440
<i>She did it again...</i>

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:31.200
She's definitely the clumsy type!

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:35.680
Now I have a reason to look 
forward to eating in the cafeteria.

00:05:35.920 --> 00:05:37.340
Thanks for the food!

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.520
Thanks for the food.

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.830
What are you doing?

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:52.660
In the spirit world, those who 
don't work are turned to stone.

00:05:52.660 --> 00:05:53.370
Also...

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:55.450
I'm punishing myself.

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.220
Punishing?

00:05:57.780 --> 00:06:00.390
Trainee, can you come here?

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:01.510
Understood.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.110
<i>What does she mean, punishing herself?</i>

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:08.130
What?

00:06:12.130 --> 00:06:13.100
How'd it go?

00:06:13.100 --> 00:06:15.060
<b>Rurumo</b>

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.060
Think it'll work out?

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:20.020
You should quit, then.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.600
You're already doin' what ya have 
to do as a trainee witch.

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:24.130
I'm punishing myself.

00:06:26.600 --> 00:06:29.450
I've been enjoying myself too much lately.

00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:35.640
<i>Punishment...</i>

00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:40.580
For these?

00:06:42.350 --> 00:06:45.360
<i>She must be irritated that 
her training hasn't ended yet...</i>

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.390
<i>I want to help you, but...</i>

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:57.470
<i>You may not know, 
but if I use these tickets,</i>

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:00.270
<i>I'll die.</i>

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:03.220
<i>Sorry, Rurumo.</i>

00:07:05.630 --> 00:07:07.690
<i>But in exchange, I'll help you.</i>

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.320
Hey, Shiba. Big news!

00:07:12.600 --> 00:07:14.390
I called that former soccer club member,

00:07:14.390 --> 00:07:16.330
and he said there's another 
locker with a hole in it.

00:07:16.580 --> 00:07:17.830
I'll pass.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.220
I need to go to the cafeteria to help my sister.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.860
Your sister?

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:26.130
That girl from yesterday really was your sister?!

00:07:26.130 --> 00:07:27.590
<b>Cafeteria</b>

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:30.620
Hey, Rurumo. I'm here to he—

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:32.550
Where's your sister? Where is she?

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:34.260
We're still setting up.

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:36.790
Guess she's not here yet.

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.410
I'll come back at lunch.

00:07:39.770 --> 00:07:41.890
I can't wait until lunch!

00:07:42.110 --> 00:07:44.690
Potatoes, potatoes, potatoes...

00:07:44.880 --> 00:07:47.740
Potatoes, potatoes, potatoes...

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:51.220
Potatoes, potatoes, potatoes...

00:07:51.220 --> 00:07:53.620
Fifteen kilograms of Aztec potatoes...

00:07:54.480 --> 00:07:55.780
Aztec potatoes?

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.290
All I need now is...

00:08:00.430 --> 00:08:04.250
A little more. Just a little more,
 and I can summon him...

00:08:04.530 --> 00:08:06.380
Are you preparing to summon Luvilca?

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:15.530
You know about the prehistoric 
Aztec civilization's Amaya family god, Luvilca?

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:18.890
His formal name is Dor na Luvica.

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:22.360
In order to summon him, you need 
fifteen kilograms of Aztec potatoes,

00:08:22.360 --> 00:08:24.440
three liters of alpaca blood,

00:08:24.820 --> 00:08:28.650
four llama hides, and four eyeballs.

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.820
He has very particular tastes.

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:37.760
That knowledge, decisiveness, 
and calm, accurate reaction...

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:40.010
You must be some kind of prodigy.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.410
Join our club!

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:43.040
I can't.

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.380
She works in the cafeteria...

00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:53.130
I forgot...

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:55.540
What did I come here to get?

00:08:57.210 --> 00:08:59.300
What was it?

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:03.730
Hmm... What should I get?

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:06.850
No way. That's Shiba's sister?

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.290
She's cute.

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.040
Isn't she?

00:09:09.040 --> 00:09:12.930
He said he didn't have one, 
but he's been hiding her from me.

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.700
He said she was an illusion.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:17.500
<i>I thought I'd help her, but it 
seems like I'd just get in the way.</i>

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.370
<i>I'll just see how this goes...</i>

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.860
I'd like the B meal.

00:09:21.860 --> 00:09:23.330
What's the B meal?

00:09:23.720 --> 00:09:26.520
<i>You should at least study that much!</i>

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:29.570
It broke.

00:09:29.570 --> 00:09:32.050
It didn't break; you broke it!

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.800
Just how clumsy are you?

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.980
If you know you're clumsy, work on it!

00:09:39.980 --> 00:09:40.640
Okay.

00:09:42.940 --> 00:09:43.890
Sorry.

00:09:45.860 --> 00:09:46.810
Sorry.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.050
<b>Udon, Soba         Ramen</b>

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:49.060
Sorry.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:50.770
Rurumo...

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.280
That's enough...

00:09:54.280 --> 00:09:55.770
Go wipe down the tables.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:09:56.570
Sorry.

00:09:59.500 --> 00:10:00.560
What?

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:02.640
Are you really Shibaki's sister?

00:10:02.640 --> 00:10:04.190
But you're so cute.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:05.660
I am.

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.710
Really?

00:10:08.610 --> 00:10:10.460
Why do I feel as though I've lost?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:13.330
It's not fair that only he has 
such a cute little sister.

00:10:13.330 --> 00:10:15.790
We're his friends, right?

00:10:15.790 --> 00:10:17.720
I don't have any trouble with girls.

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:19.010
What?!

00:10:25.430 --> 00:10:27.940
She tripped over nothing again...

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.710
Are you okay, Rurumo?

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:37.360
Jeez, what are you doing?

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:40.910
I can stand on my own.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.200
Don't help me again.

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:45.210
What?

00:10:45.210 --> 00:10:47.830
This is my punishment.

00:10:50.320 --> 00:10:51.520
Punishment?

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.960
Outta the blue 
she said she 
wanted to work,
 so I got her a job.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:56.960
I wonder 
if it's 
goin' well.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:02.210
<i>A few days have passed 
since Rurumo started working.</i>

00:11:03.210 --> 00:11:07.230
<i>As usual, I have no idea what she's thinking.</i>

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:11.100
<i>Meanwhile, an incident occurred.</i>

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.850
<b>Mysterious Discovery Club</b>

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.820
Someone asked to join the club today.

00:11:16.490 --> 00:11:17.440
Someone wants to join?

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:20.280
Is it the female member I've dreamed of?

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.950
Of course not...

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:26.990
<b>Entrance Ceremony</b>

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.210
Spring!

00:11:26.210 --> 00:11:26.990
New students!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:28.750
Girls!

00:11:29.240 --> 00:11:31.870
Is what happens in April...

00:11:33.360 --> 00:11:35.310
It's already June.

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:37.700
Who wants to join our club now?

00:11:39.690 --> 00:11:40.720
Excuse me.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:49.040
I'm Kujirai Tanako from class 1-1.

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:50.560
Nice to meet you.

00:11:54.490 --> 00:11:56.360
Goal!

00:11:56.640 --> 00:11:58.790
Seriously? This is Kujirai-san!

00:11:58.790 --> 00:12:00.370
Kujirai-san!

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:02.620
You know her, Shibaraku?

00:12:02.620 --> 00:12:06.630
In the new student cuteness ranking 
I made with Nishino, Sugawara,

00:12:06.630 --> 00:12:11.110
and "Deep Smile" Sakurai, the expert 
on cute smiles, she easily placed first!

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.660
<b>Number 1</b>

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:12.660
I don't know anything about that.

00:12:12.660 --> 00:12:14.420
Kujirai Tanako, 15 years old.

00:12:14.420 --> 00:12:18.700
We estimate her measurements 
to be 83, 60, and 85, from the top.

00:12:20.000 --> 00:12:22.670
According to our data, 
she joined the basketball club.

00:12:22.670 --> 00:12:24.130
She quit.

00:12:24.130 --> 00:12:25.280
What?

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:29.430
Do you love mysteries so much,
 you were willing to quit another club?

00:12:30.400 --> 00:12:31.160
Huh?

00:12:33.650 --> 00:12:35.190
Yes, I love them.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:37.940
<b>Welcome</b>

00:12:39.280 --> 00:12:42.680
I actually love mysteries, too.

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:44.360
So, do you like UFOs? Or...

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.660
You're Shibaki-san the pervert, right?

00:12:47.490 --> 00:12:50.200
You seem nicer than the rumors say!

00:12:50.200 --> 00:12:50.700
Huh?

00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:52.870
Nice?

00:12:53.300 --> 00:12:54.250
Yes.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.000
Seriously?

00:12:57.000 --> 00:12:58.660
Yes, seriously.

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.800
What a good girl. Good job, Senpai!

00:13:02.800 --> 00:13:04.500
Don't be fooled by appearances.

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:05.190
What?

00:13:05.190 --> 00:13:08.430
She said she'd join our club on one condition.

00:13:09.340 --> 00:13:11.270
That condition is...

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:15.390
I love mysteries,

00:13:15.900 --> 00:13:17.310
because I'm a...

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.690
<b>WITCH</b>

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:19.690
witch!

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:22.860
We have to acknowledge her as a witch.

00:13:27.070 --> 00:13:29.530
I will now prove it to you 
with a magical demonstration.

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.490
<i>She's a little awkward,</i>

00:13:37.490 --> 00:13:40.340
<i>but it's a miracle for a girl to 
join the Mysterious Discovery Club.</i>

00:13:40.340 --> 00:13:43.280
<i>We'll never have this chance again. We must...</i>

00:13:43.280 --> 00:13:44.530
<i>No, wait...</i>

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:48.180
Moving La Luna!

00:13:51.040 --> 00:13:54.720
<i>She stuck it on with glue or something to move it!</i>

00:13:58.510 --> 00:13:59.550
Huh?

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.900
Come on!

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:06.440
My Destruction La Luna was a success!

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:08.860
<i>This girl is strong!</i>

00:14:09.350 --> 00:14:11.270
How was that?

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.090
It—

00:14:13.850 --> 00:14:16.820
It looked like your magic went out 
of control a bit at the end.

00:14:16.820 --> 00:14:17.870
Yeah!

00:14:18.240 --> 00:14:20.500
<i>Shibaki's abandoned his own heart!</i>

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.480
There! Floating La Luna!

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:25.300
Listen. Women are like sheep.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.730
Sheep form flocks. 
They call their own kind.

00:14:30.790 --> 00:14:34.190
In other words, if she sticks around,
 her friends will come.

00:14:34.190 --> 00:14:37.260
What's important isn't the present. 
It's the future!

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.810
You're really into this, Shibaraku.

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.990
That floating magic was impressive.
 How did you do it?

00:14:44.220 --> 00:14:46.570
That wasn't magic.

00:14:47.030 --> 00:14:50.630
You should know that very well, Kota.

00:14:50.630 --> 00:14:51.530
<i>There she is!</i>

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.360
<i>The real witch!</i>

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:57.250
It's the prodigal girl!

00:14:57.250 --> 00:14:58.120
I can't.

00:14:58.480 --> 00:14:59.900
Are you okay?

00:14:59.900 --> 00:15:00.830
President...

00:15:01.280 --> 00:15:04.730
What are you doing here, anyway?

00:15:04.730 --> 00:15:08.400
Me? I kind of made a mess in the cafeteria...

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:11.300
Those are the table cloths from the cafeteria!

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.330
I'm leaving now.

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:14.970
Wait!

00:15:15.780 --> 00:15:16.810
That girl...

00:15:17.290 --> 00:15:19.830
Uh, she works in the cafeteria.

00:15:19.830 --> 00:15:22.400
I know. She's the trainee Rurumo-san.

00:15:22.400 --> 00:15:25.370
Oh. Well, I know your characters are 
redundant, but don't worry about it.

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:26.650
I'm not a character.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:27.500
I know!

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.030
I was watching.

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:36.200
I've always been watching her...

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:38.950
Let's have a showdown.

00:15:39.880 --> 00:15:41.680
That will make it clear

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:44.940
which of us is closer to the real thing.

00:15:45.380 --> 00:15:46.290
Why?

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:47.630
Because...

00:15:47.930 --> 00:15:52.740
<i>I see. This girl became a witch so 
she could face off against Rurumo...</i>

00:15:52.740 --> 00:15:55.130
Anyway, it's a magical girl showdown!

00:15:55.130 --> 00:15:58.010
There's someone you like in this club, isn't there?

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:01.310
That's why you tried to join 
the Mysterious Discovery Club.

00:16:01.650 --> 00:16:02.400
No...

00:16:02.830 --> 00:16:04.310
I mean, yes...

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:07.900
Since I saw you at the club fair 
during the entrance ceremony,

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.940
I haven't been able to forget you...

00:16:10.250 --> 00:16:12.700
But you wouldn't even look at me...

00:16:13.280 --> 00:16:15.820
So I wanted you to acknowledge me...

00:16:17.700 --> 00:16:18.900
Got it?

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:22.710
We'll have a magical girl showdown tomorrow!

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:25.820
Showdown? What is she talking about, Shibaraku?

00:16:27.000 --> 00:16:29.210
I can't believe I didn't notice.

00:16:29.600 --> 00:16:30.970
But I understand now.

00:16:30.970 --> 00:16:33.800
The kindness I felt then was real.

00:16:35.190 --> 00:16:36.720
I'm leveling up!

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:40.200
I'm about to level up as a man!

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:43.690
That's high.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.620
You're stiff here, too. How's that?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.990
That feels good. Thank you.

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:52.440
But where did this come from?

00:16:52.440 --> 00:16:55.420
You always take care of me,
 so I should help you sometimes.

00:16:55.420 --> 00:16:58.260
How unusual. I bet it'll rain tomorrow.

00:16:58.260 --> 00:16:59.730
Nah, it'll snow.

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:02.210
I have a magical girl showdown tomorrow.

00:17:02.210 --> 00:17:04.660
A magical girl showdown? What's that?

00:17:04.710 --> 00:17:07.130
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:17:08.630 --> 00:17:10.380
First we'll have a movement magic showdown!

00:17:11.050 --> 00:17:15.090
The one who moves all the balls 
without using her hands wins!

00:17:17.060 --> 00:17:18.960
That's magic?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.830
Just let it slide.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:22.430
I have no choice. Chiro.

00:17:24.480 --> 00:17:26.660
She's controlling a black cat?!

00:17:26.660 --> 00:17:27.820
What an upset.

00:17:27.820 --> 00:17:29.840
Prodigy girl wins!

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.420
This is next!

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:32.610
We'll make this float!

00:17:34.770 --> 00:17:35.630
Float?

00:17:35.630 --> 00:17:37.070
You're smarter than you look!

00:17:37.600 --> 00:17:39.120
Why don't we stop here?

00:17:40.100 --> 00:17:41.680
In that case...

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.600
It's time for the final showdown!

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:46.250
Tanako-chan!

00:17:48.610 --> 00:17:51.400
Walking-on-air magic.

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:52.560
What are you doing?

00:17:52.560 --> 00:17:55.130
That's not magic! Get down!

00:17:55.130 --> 00:17:56.880
Well? Can you do this?

00:17:57.700 --> 00:17:58.300
I can't.

00:18:06.790 --> 00:18:08.320
<i>Look, Senpai.</i>

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.400
<i>Don't look at the magical girl. Look at me...</i>

00:18:13.940 --> 00:18:14.960
<i>At me!</i>

00:18:14.960 --> 00:18:17.830
I get it! I understand how you feel!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.780
You don't have to fight anymore!

00:18:19.780 --> 00:18:20.630
Senpai?

00:18:20.630 --> 00:18:21.890
She's my sister!

00:18:21.890 --> 00:18:23.410
Rurumo's my sister!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:25.200
Huh?

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:28.540
Damn it! Rurumo!

00:18:29.290 --> 00:18:30.710
Magic!

00:18:30.940 --> 00:18:32.190
Look, a UMA.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.810
UMA? An unidentified mysterious animal?

00:18:33.810 --> 00:18:34.670
Where? Where is it?

00:18:36.960 --> 00:18:37.880
Magic activate!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:39.390
Baltos.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:49.080
I'm saved.

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:51.650
Hey!

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.690
You saved me with your magic...

00:18:56.000 --> 00:18:58.400
No, with your supernatural powers.

00:18:59.990 --> 00:19:01.320
<i>Because you're...</i>

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:03.280
Senpai!

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:05.740
Come on! Jump into my arms!

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:06.790
I love you!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:08.540
I love mysteries!

00:19:10.140 --> 00:19:12.680
Thank you, Senpai!

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:12.080
Are you okay?

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:15.270
The sheep... My plan...

00:19:12.680 --> 00:19:16.250
For what? What are you doing? Stop that!

00:19:14.810 --> 00:19:16.250
But, but!

00:19:16.240 --> 00:19:18.310
I still have work to do. I'm leaving now.

00:19:16.250 --> 00:19:18.310
Let go of me!

00:19:27.960 --> 00:19:29.560
You did it again, huh?

00:19:30.190 --> 00:19:31.900
Here, use this.

00:19:31.900 --> 00:19:33.010
I don't need it.

00:19:33.010 --> 00:19:33.860
Yes, you do.

00:19:35.360 --> 00:19:36.590
I told you before, I don't—

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:38.100
I hate to say it...

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.030
But you're not cut out to 
be anything but a witch.

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:46.290
You can't serve people, follow instructions, 
and defer to superiors, can you?

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.790
Come to your senses. 
You can't do normal work.

00:19:51.500 --> 00:19:52.640
I know.

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.620
I'm a slow learner.

00:19:57.140 --> 00:19:59.520
I take longer than others.

00:19:59.520 --> 00:20:03.970
It took me five years to learn 
the simplest movement magic.

00:20:04.410 --> 00:20:07.680
I don't have the coordination to ride a broom.

00:20:08.630 --> 00:20:10.920
But I do it anyway.

00:20:10.920 --> 00:20:12.560
That's my decision.

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:16.080
This is the punishment I chose for myself.

00:20:16.520 --> 00:20:18.190
What punishment?

00:20:18.910 --> 00:20:22.400
Just wear your cape and act 
distinguished like a witch should.

00:20:28.480 --> 00:20:30.040
You're really stupid.

00:20:30.490 --> 00:20:31.030
Huh?

00:20:31.030 --> 00:20:34.080
You're the only one who's been kind to me.

00:20:35.020 --> 00:20:38.090
I've been bullied and tricked...

00:20:38.360 --> 00:20:41.260
You did say you were imprisoned 
because someone tricked you.

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:44.910
Witches are not to come to Earth 
without being summoned.

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:48.510
Someone told me I had been summoned,
 so I used magic on Earth.

00:20:51.860 --> 00:20:53.260
I'll do the rest.

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:04.030
<i>You're so stupid, I'm enjoying myself.</i>

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:10.450
<b>Kota</b>

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:13.080
By the way, what'd she mean by punishment?

00:21:13.430 --> 00:21:14.610
Who knows?

00:21:14.610 --> 00:21:17.520
Sometimes I don't understand Rurumo.

00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:23.720
<i>You're her big brother. You should 
choose her clothes for her.</i>

00:21:27.270 --> 00:21:29.970
<i>Not bad. Nice, nice.</i>

00:21:30.240 --> 00:21:31.680
<i>Yep, it's cute.</i>

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:34.710
<i>Cute?</i>

00:21:47.650 --> 00:21:49.000
This is my punishment.

00:23:21.120 --> 00:23:23.270
Rurumo, you go up the stairs first.

00:23:23.270 --> 00:23:24.550
Ladies first.

00:23:24.550 --> 00:23:25.210
Thanks.

00:23:25.210 --> 00:23:26.780
Don't fall for his trap!

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:28.800
He plans to look up your skirt!

00:23:28.800 --> 00:23:30.730
Isn't that right, Shibaki the Pervert?

00:23:30.730 --> 00:23:33.380
The next episode is "Inoue-san the Student Monitor."

00:23:31.300 --> 00:23:34.970
<b>Next Episode: Inoue-san the Student Monitor</b>

00:23:33.380 --> 00:23:34.970
How dependable.
